{"id":"92ef5d19605886fd","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-primrec-operator.md","title":"Typed Primitive Recursion","display":"df-primrec-operator — Typed Primitive Recursion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-primrec-operator","aliases":["57-df-primrec-operator"],"display":"df-primrec-operator — Typed Primitive Recursion","depends_on":["[[57-df-composition-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-primrec-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-primrec-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primrec-operator — Typed Primitive Recursion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal P_n\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal P_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathcal P_{n+2}\">\\(h\\in\\mathcal P_{n+2}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n,\\mathcal P_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n\">\\(D_n,\\mathcal P_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\">\\(\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\)</span>，有限轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec z=\\langle z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\rangle\">\\(\\vec z=\\langle z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\rangle\\)</span> 明确按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,y\">\\(0,\\ldots,y\\)</span> 编号。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,z,z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(y,z,z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；不带下标的 PPrimRec、PrimRec 使用本次固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g()\">\\(g()\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\langle\\rangle)\">\\(g(\\langle\\rangle)\\)</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0\">\\(D_0\\)</span> 的点值接口确定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PPrimRec}_{n}(g,h)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y\\rangle),z\\rangle:\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land y,z\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^{y+1}\\;[\n\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x),z_0\\rangle\\in g\\land z_y=z\\land\n\\forall j&lt;y\\;\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+2}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,j,z_j\\rangle),z_{j+1}\\rangle\\in h]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PPrimRec}_{n}(g,h)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y\\rangle),z\\rangle:\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land y,z\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^{y+1}\\;[\n\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x),z_0\\rangle\\in g\\land z_y=z\\land\n\\forall j&lt;y\\;\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+2}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,j,z_j\\rangle),z_{j+1}\\rangle\\in h]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PPrimRec}(g,h)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PPrimRec}_n(g,h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PPrimRec}(g,h)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PPrimRec}_n(g,h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PPrimRec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal P_{n+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PPrimRec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal P_{n+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PPrimRec}(g,h)\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PPrimRec}(g,h)\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}\\to\n\\left[\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\land\n\\forall\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,0)&amp;=g(x_1,\\ldots,x_n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y+1)&amp;=h(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y,\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y))\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}\\to\n\\left[\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\land\n\\forall\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,0)&amp;=g(x_1,\\ldots,x_n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y+1)&amp;=h(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y,\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y))\n\\end{aligned}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>括号中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x,y,z\">\\(\\vec x,y,z\\)</span> 表示展开后的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y,z\">\\(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y,z\\)</span>，由已给定的打包映射唯一确定；不把嵌套有序对当成平坦输入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$g\\in\\mathcal P_n$，$h\\in\\mathcal P_{n+2}$；$D_n,\\mathcal P_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。$\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle$，有限轨迹 $\\vec z=\\langle z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\rangle$ 明确按 $0,\\ldots,y$ 编号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathcal P_n","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathcal P_{n+2}","display":false},{"tex":"D_n,\\mathcal P_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec z=\\langle z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,y","display":false},{"tex":"y,z,z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"g()","display":false},{"tex":"g(\\langle\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"D_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PPrimRec}_{n}(g,h)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y\\rangle),z\\rangle:\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\land y,z\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^{y+1}\\;[\n\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x),z_0\\rangle\\in g\\land z_y=z\\land\n\\forall j<y\\;\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+2}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,j,z_j\\rangle),z_{j+1}\\rangle\\in h]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PPrimRec}(g,h)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PPrimRec}_n(g,h).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PPrimRec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal P_{n+1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PPrimRec}(g,h)\\quad(g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}).","display":true},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathcal F_n\\land h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}\\to\n\\left[\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal F_{n+1}\\land\n\\forall\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,0)&=g(x_1,\\ldots,x_n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y+1)&=h(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y,\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g,h)(x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y))\n\\end{aligned}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\vec x,y,z","display":false},{"tex":"x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y,z","display":false}],"bytes":1924,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6b94974722658c7","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,i\\in\\mathbb N$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$ 是整个调用环境中的固定参数；$\\beta:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 为下式定义的函数，公开接口仍只有 $a,i$ 两个参数。$\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem},\\mathrm{fact},\\pi_i^n$ 分别取 [[57-df-addition-function]]、[[57-df-multiplication-function]]、[[57-df-divrem-function]]、[[57-df-factorial-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]；$\\mathrm{PR}$、复合及原始递归取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]、[[57-df-composition-operator]]、[[57-df-primrec-operator]]。"},{"id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z,S,\\pi_i^n$ 取 [[57-df-zero-function]]、[[57-df-successor-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]；$Z$ 仍为一元零函数。$D_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\mathrm{Comp}$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$\\mathrm{PrimRec}$ 取 [[57-df-primrec-operator]]。固定 $F=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathcal F_n$ 作为 [[57-df-function-closure]] 的闭包论域。$m\\ge1$，$g,h,f_1,\\ldots,f_m\\in F$；$f\\in F$。$C_m:F^{m+1}\\to F$ 和 $R:F^2\\to F$ 在下式定义；类型不相容时返回同一个 $Z$。"},{"id":"4bf1a2a7d352c15e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_n,\\mathcal P_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\mathrm{PComp}$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]，$\\mathrm{PPrimRec}$ 取 [[57-df-primrec-operator]]，$\\mathrm{MinGen}$ 取 [[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]。$\\mathrm{PR}_n$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。$r,n\\in\\mathbb N$；下述闭包按 $r$ 同时递归。每个算子的元数参数取该集合生成式中明示的元数，不从空部分函数图猜测。$\\chi_P:D_n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是由下式定义的特征函数；$P\\subseteq D_n$。"},{"id":"7944760e23c02c51","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z,\\pi_i^k,\\mathrm{Comp},\\mathrm{PrimRec},\\mathrm{PR}_k$ 分别取 [[57-df-zero-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]、[[57-df-composition-operator]]、[[57-df-primrec-operator]]、[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]；原始递归参数位于最后，$Z$ 保持一元。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-subtraction-function]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"}],"outgoing":["7463e44f61370c84"]}